tools.description:
Get a five-minute Ed25519 signed presence observation. Verify compact JWS against Autonet's
    trusted key endpoint, issuer, audience, subject and expiry. Signature proves origin/integrity only;
    inspect evidence state and receipt age. Not an identity, reachability or safety certificate.

Register a real worker once. Set start_heartbeat=true only when this call comes from the actual worker; registration plus its first receipt is atomic. Heartbeat mode needs no endpoint and reports contact only.
    Probe mode requires your own deployed readiness URL. Store the returned owner key securely;
    it is shown once. Private by default; visibility=public explicitly shares status and presence. Contact, note and version remain private. Never invent monitoring activity.
